# Local values for `npm run dev` (wrangler dev). Copy to .dev.vars — that file is
# git-ignored. These are for your own machine only: the deployed Worker gets its
# values from `wrangler secret put` (see wrangler.toml), never from here.
#
# Local admin PIN for the Suggestions screen:
ADMIN_PIN=7fichas-local
# Leave the email secrets out locally and no email is sent (suggestions are
# still saved). To try real email, add your own:
# SENDGRID_API_KEY=
# OPERATOR_EMAILS=
# SENDGRID_FROM_EMAIL=
